    "created_at": "2016-05-02T15:33:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-02T15:33:31Z",
    "body": "Edge does -1. Safari does -1. (Test: http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=4131; Edge doesn't like data: URLs in the address bar.)\n\nI agree it'd be more logical unsigned, but this is a legacy attribute anyway so we should probably just go for the shortest route to compat. Are you OK with closing? Link us to any web-platform-tests and Firefox bugs you file.\n\nFYI @DigiTec since he seems to enjoy these kind of obscure compat edge cases with HTML element interfaces ;)\n",
