    "created_at": "2016-05-02T17:25:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-02T17:27:16Z",
    "body": "This is becoming an interesting compat area for us. Legacy content written in markup, is generally not prepared to have the same parsing semantics as the property setter which is defined by ES ToString/ToInt/ToNumber, etc... semantics. \n\nWidth of -1 is likely also a lie, since formatting probably snaps the value to either 0 or 1 depending on the property.\n\nGood with keeping this for now, but we should track these to make sure it doesn't become a broader problem.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
